WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.540
It's 10:14 at night. Somebody just called your business.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.030
You're closed. The call goes to voicemail. And up to 85% of them may never call back.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.250
What if your front desk never closed?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:32.690
24x7 AI answers. Understands the problem. Books the job.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.610
Straight into the calendar you already use.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.150
After hours, every lead is captured, flagged, and sent to you.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.600
Your words. Your rules. Your tools.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:03.760
Every call recorded, transcribed, and ready to review.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.202
Go live in 48 hours. You test it before it goes live.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.820
24x7 AI. Your business, always open.
